      "category": "cloud-container",
      "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/cloud-container/cve-2022-0492-cgroup-release-agent.md",
      "mirror_ref": "skills/kb-cloud-container/cve-2022-0492-cgroup-release-agent.md",
      "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-cloud-container/cve-2022-0492-cgroup-release-agent.md",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "cgroups release_agent 容器逃逸",
        "cve": "CVE-2022-0492",
        "severity": "high",
        "source_cvss": "7.8",
        "product": "Linux kernel cgroup v1",
        "versions": "5.16.2 之前（多数容器宿主）",
        "ports": "本地",
        "keywords": "cgroup, release_agent, escape, cap_sys_admin, container",
        "verified": "false",
        "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
      },
      "fingerprint": "- 容器内 `cat /proc/self/status | grep Cap` 含 `CAP_SYS_ADMIN`（或 `unshare -UrC` 可用）。\n- `mount | grep cgroup` 有 cgroup v1 挂载；`/sys/fs/cgroup/release_agent` 存在。",
      "preconditions": "- 容器内具备 `CAP_SYS_ADMIN`（特权容器/部分 CI runner）或有可用 userns + cgroup 命名空间。",
      "remediation_source": "- 升级内核到 5.16.2+；容器不要给 `CAP_SYS_ADMIN`；启用 userns 隔离与 cgroup v2。",
      "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2022-0492；Unit 42 分析。",
      "references": []
    },
